WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
The chicken shortage has arrived

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,640
The protector will disappear after today

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,480
Stop at Rossriere Springs tomorrow

4
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:07,680
Bring space to Chaos Star

5
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:10,000
Please try your best to live, senior

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,360
There are only four hours today

7
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,240
And the protector is only available for today.

8
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,140
Let’s go to Zhushe to have a look today.

9
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:19,360
White Fang

10
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:20,840
There is a box over there

11
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:24,160
It happens to be not far away. It's such a coincidence. That's just right.

12
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,920
I even touched the box.

13
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,280
Senior, we are here

14
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:29,600
That little wooden house seems to be Zhu Fuzhen

15
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,360
Go and have a look

16
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,560
Senior, let's see if we can open it.

17
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:37,420
How does this work?

18
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:40,220
There is no hint, senior

19
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,420
Why don't you throw that scroll in and try it?
